    "deck_name": "Saved Cards",
    "note_type_style": "saCloze++",
    "fields": {
      "Text": "Mass beneath a congenital skin patch. What is the most likely diagnosis?<br><br>{{c1::Intramuscular vascular malformation}}<br><br><img src=\"stlecture_ct_f21_single_v1.jpg\">",
      "Extra": "A large feeding vessel and mixed fatty and vascular components support a vascular lesion. The caption reports a capillary vascular malformation at resection.<br><br>Subhawong et al. AJR 2010, Figure 21, PDF page 7.<br><br><img src=\"stlecture_ct_source_page_07_v1.jpg\"><br><a href=\"https://starfox1230.github.io/The-Library/apps/temporary-apps/library/2026-10-18-soft-tissue-lecture/papers/ct-soft-tissue-masses.pdf#page=7\">Open source PDF</a>"
