      "Extra": "The lesion matches subcutaneous fat on T1 and suppresses uniformly, without thick septa or a nodular nonfat component.<br><br>Wu and Hochman. Radiology 2009, Figure 1, PDF page 5.<br><br><img src=\"stlecture_mr_source_page_05_v1.jpg\"><br><a href=\"https://starfox1230.github.io/The-Library/apps/temporary-apps/library/2026-10-18-soft-tissue-lecture/papers/mri-systematic-approach.pdf#page=5\">Open source PDF</a>"
