      "Extra": "The lobulated mass follows the index-finger flexor tendon sheath and is relatively low/intermediate signal on T1 and T2.<br><br>Wu and Hochman. Radiology 2009, Figure 6, PDF page 7.<br><br><img src=\"stlecture_mr_source_page_07_v1.jpg\"><br><a href=\"https://starfox1230.github.io/The-Library/apps/temporary-apps/library/2026-10-18-soft-tissue-lecture/papers/mri-systematic-approach.pdf#page=7\">Open source PDF</a>"
