      "Text": "Recent trauma. What is the most likely diagnosis?<br><br>{{c1::Hematoma}}<br><br>1/4<br><img src=\"stlecture_mr_f20_a_v1.jpg\"><br><img src=\"stlecture_mr_f20_b_v1.jpg\"><br><img src=\"stlecture_mr_f20_c_v1.jpg\"><br><img src=\"stlecture_mr_f20_d_v1.jpg\">",
      "Extra": "The mass remains T1 bright with fat suppression, but subtraction shows no solid internal enhancement. A presumed hematoma that does not resolve needs reassessment.<br><br>Wu and Hochman. Radiology 2009, Figure 20, PDF page 16.<br><br><img src=\"stlecture_mr_source_page_16_v1.jpg\"><br><a href=\"https://starfox1230.github.io/The-Library/apps/temporary-apps/library/2026-10-18-soft-tissue-lecture/papers/mri-systematic-approach.pdf#page=16\">Open source PDF</a>"
